Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:15.04,Pill,,0,0,0,,WHY THAT DAY?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.92,0:00:37.11,Pill,,0,0,0,,WHO'S WATCHING YOURS?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.26,0:00:01.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,In 2016,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.41,0:00:03.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,hackers stole $81 million
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.96,0:00:05.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,from a central bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,And they picked the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:07.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,day on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:08.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,They struck just as
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.29,0:00:09.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,the bank closed for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.19,0:00:10.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:11.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,New York was off next.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.96,0:00:13.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then the country the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:13.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,money went to shut
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.94,0:00:14.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,for a holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:16.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,By the time everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:17.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,was back at their desks,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.44,0:00:19.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,the money was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.45,0:00:20.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,It still works.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.84,0:00:22.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,The FBI has seen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.44,0:00:23.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,more big attacks on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:24.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,holidays and weekends,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:25.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,when fewer people are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:26.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,on watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:28.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,And this Diwali,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.37,0:00:29.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,millions of us will
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:30.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,be shopping,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:31.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,gifting and sending money
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.94,0:00:33.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,while offices close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:34.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,So who's watching your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.85,0:00:36.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,money while everyone celebrates?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.23,0:00:37.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,With BLOK,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.85,0:00:38.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,your fund sits in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.62,0:00:40.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,an account only you control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:41.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,No bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.32,0:00:42.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,no broker,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.09,0:00:42.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,not even us can
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.83,0:00:43.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,move it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:44.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every move is on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:45.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,a public record you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:46.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,can check,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:47.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,any hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.33,0:00:48.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,any holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.60,0:00:50.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,And anyone can start one,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:51.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,from just $10.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.37,0:00:53.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,So go celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.58,0:00:55.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Your money stays yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:57.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,Happy Diwali from BLOK.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:59.20,Small,,0,0,0,,Educational only, not financial advice. Investing carries risk. AI-generated voiceover and 3D.
